Lucide icons in VibeOS
======================

Origin  : https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide, the lucide-static 1.61.0 npm package (icons/*.svg)
Licence : ISC, with the icons derived from Feather under MIT (Cole Bemis); both notices are in LICENSE
Files   : only the 132 icons listed in common/icons.h (ICON_LIST), byte-for-byte; LICENSE is the package's.

tools/mkicons.py re-strokes them (1.5 px at 16 px, 1.75 px at 20 px, round caps/joins) and tools/svgrast.c
rasterises them with nanosvg at build time into build/gen/icons.c. To add an icon: copy its SVG here from the same
package version and add an X(ID, "name") line to ICON_LIST.
